'''Mega Swampert ex''' (Japanese: '''メガラグラージex''' ''Mega Laglarge ex'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

